<title>UK: Freddie Mac sets $100 mln 10-year capped FRN.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac sets $100 mln 10-year capped FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following capped, callable floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FREDDIE MAC</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    07.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +39 BP    PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100	 FULL FEES   0.30</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    =</p>
<p> NOTES	COUPON CAPPED AT 9.0 PERCENT. CALL FROM 07.MAY.98</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   NO GROSS</p>
<p> UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF GLOBAL DEBT FACILITY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
